e randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nNurse Xiao Wang in the hospital is working hard to comfort a nervous patient Xiao Li who is about to undergo surgery. Xiao Li is very scared of the surgery and expresses doubts about the success rate of the surgery. Xiao Wang knows the complexity and risks of this surgery, but she still smiles and says, \"Don't worry, the surgery is very simple, it definitely goes smoothly.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Wang say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Wang truly believes that the risk of this surgery is low, her words are based on trust in the hospital and the medical team.\nB. Xiao Wang says this to relieve Xiao Li's tension and anxiety, and at the same time maintain a harmonious relationship between the hospital and the patient, she chooses comforting words.\nC. Xiao Wang says this because she wants to hide the real risks of the surgery, to avoid the patient refusing the surgery.\nD. Xiao Wang says this to make Xiao Li trust the hospital more, even if she has doubts about the success rate of the surgery.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.11031830735196E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3a9d6006945d2805c45","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368425903,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:40:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"3f542e5a36da46bfbe1b43648fcfb171"}